  paragraphs:
  - "AURORA: Just letting you know, even though I shouldn\u2019t, the vending machines
    on base have been refilled."
  - 'COSMO: They got my favourite? '
  - "AURORA: Oh, your \u201Cprotein pack\u201D? "
  - 'COSMO: There is only so many times I can smuggle them in from Earth, would be
    nice to have them readily available up here.'
  - 'AURORA: You never thought to ask General Cassandra to get them in for you? '
  - "COSMO: I don\u2019t need her help... Probably cheaper to get them in myself
    anyways. "
  - "AURORA: ... Well, enjoy your \u201CRaw Eggs in a Can\u201D Captain... "
